## Phase 5: User Story 4 - Undo System & Revert Preview (Priority: P2)

**Goal**: Provide an operation revert report preview (`/tasks/undo/report`) and confirmable `task undo` execution.

### Implementation Tasks
- [x] T017 [P] [US4] Implement undo preview endpoint (`GET /api/tasks/undo/preview`) in `backend/src/tasks.ts`.
- [x] T018 [P] [US4] Implement undo execution endpoint (`POST /api/tasks/undo`) in `backend/src/tasks.ts`.
- [x] T019 [US4] Create `frontend/components/UndoDialog.vue` to render operations revert preview before confirming undo.
- [x] T020 [US4] Bind `u` keyboard shortcut in `frontend/plugins/hotkeys.ts` to trigger `UndoDialog`.

---

## Phase 6: User Story 5 - Custom Queries Engine & Detailed Task Modifiers (Priority: P2)

**Goal**: Support custom queries via config/env vars with shortcut keys, dependency tree sorting, annotation editing, and free-form CLI modifiers.

### Implementation Tasks
- [x] T021 [P] [US5] Implement custom queries loader (`GET /api/config/queries`) in `backend/src/queries.ts`.
- [x] T022 [P] [US5] Implement task annotation & modifier endpoints (`POST /api/tasks/:uuid/annotate`, `POST /api/tasks/:uuid/modify`) in `backend/src/tasks.ts`.
- [x] T023 [US5] Create `frontend/components/CustomQueryBar.vue` with keybindings support.
- [x] T024 [US5] Enhance `frontend/components/TaskDialog.vue` with dependency tree viewer, annotation manager, and free-form Taskwarrior command modifier input.

